    {"id":9,"type":"timeseries","title":"Query Path — Embedded QueryNode Worker","description":"StreamingNode embeds a QueryNode role for growing segments in Milvus 2.6. If this rises with CPU while WAL stays flat, CPU is primarily query work.","datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"gridPos":{"h":8,"w":24,"x":0,"y":20},"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"unit":"short","color":{"mode":"palette-classic"}},"overrides":[]},"options":{"legend":{"displayMode":"table","placement":"bottom","showLegend":true,"calcs":["lastNotNull","max"]},"tooltip":{"mode":"multi"}},"targets":[{"expr":"sum(milvus_querynode_pool_active_threads{component=\"streamingnode\"})","legendFormat":"Active query threads","refId":"A"},{"expr":"sum(milvus_querynode_pool_queue_depth{component=\"streamingnode\"})","legendFormat":"Query queue depth","refId":"B"},{"expr":"sum(milvus_querynode_read_task_ready_len{component=\"streamingnode\"})","legendFormat":"Ready query tasks","refId":"C"}]},
    {"id":10,"type":"timeseries","title":"Actual Vector Search vs Write Activity","description":"Use this panel to distinguish work type. StreamingNode vector searches represent growing-segment ANN work; QueryNode vector searches represent sealed-segment ANN work. If both StreamingNode search and WAL are flat while StreamingNode CPU rises, it is primarily coordinating and reducing query results.","datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"gridPos":{"h":8,"w":24,"x":0,"y":28},"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"unit":"ops","color":{"mode":"palette-classic"}},"overrides":[]},"options":{"legend":{"displayMode":"table","placement":"bottom","showLegend":true,"calcs":["lastNotNull","max","mean"]},"tooltip":{"mode":"multi","sort":"desc"}},"targets":[{"expr":"sum(rate(search_latency_count{component=\"streamingnode\"}[$__rate_interval]))","legendFormat":"StreamingNode vector searches/s (growing)","refId":"A"},{"expr":"sum(rate(search_latency_count{component=\"querynode\"}[$__rate_interval]))","legendFormat":"QueryNode vector searches/s (sealed)","refId":"B"},{"expr":"sum(rate(milvus_wal_append_message_total{component=\"streamingnode\"}[$__rate_interval]))","legendFormat":"StreamingNode WAL messages/s","refId":"C"}]}
